    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a start but it feels a bit vague for a news story. can u go deeper on the opposition side? it feels like a lot of people are just being really reactionary and resistant to change, like they're just stuck in the old way of doing things. is there any actual logic to their side or is it mostly just fear of change?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
